WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.740
VidSearch: VidSearch is a lightweight multimodal video understanding and retrieval

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:09.450
What it is: VidSearch is a lightweight multimodal video

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:16.280
Capabilities: It extracts key frames from video

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:21.320
Features: Frame Extraction: vidsearch.frames samples video keyframes

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:26.620
vidsearch/cli.py: is the command-line interface for VidSearch

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:32.590
vidsearch/search.py: query vector index and rank matching

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.830
main: run CLI search execution

00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:41.380
Calls: parse_args and search_video_index

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:44.780
Install: pip install -r requirements.txt

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:48.400
Run: python -m vidsearch.cli --query "sunset

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:53.830
Summary: VidSearch is a lightweight multimodal video
